C*******************************************************************************
C                          File Description
C
C   This data file contains the parameters and data file names for the simulation
C   of root zone processes for native and riparian vegetation.
C
C*******************************************************************************
C         Number of Native and Riparian Vegetation Categories and Codes
C
C   NNTV     ; Number of native vegetation categories 
C   NRPN     ; Number of riparian vegetation categories
C   CCODE    ; Vegetation codes (max. 10 characters)
C               (1 to NNTV + NRPN)
C               * Note: First native vegetation category codes must be listed, 
C                       then riparian vegetation category codes
C   LUFLNVRV ; File that lists the land use areas (max. 1000 characters)
C
C--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C   VALUE                                          DESCRIPTION
C--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    1                                              / NNTV
    1                                              / NRPN
    NV                                             / CCODE[1]   Native Vegetation
    RV                                             / CCODE[2]   Riparian Vegetation
    RootZone\C2VSimCG_NativeVeg_Area.dat           / LUFLNVRV
C*******************************************************************************
C                              Rooting Depths 
C
C   FACT  ;  Conversion factor for root zone depths 
C   ROOT  ;  Root zone depth; [L]
C             * List the root zone depths in the same order as the vegetation 
C               codes (CCODE) are listed above; first for native categories, 
C               then for riparian categories
C
C--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C   VALUE                 DESCRIPTION
C--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    1.0                   / FACT
    5.0                   / ROOTNV
    5.0                   / ROOTRV
C*******************************************************************************
C         Native and Riparian Vegetation Root Zone Simulation Parameters 
C
C   IE     ;  Element ID (0 if following values are to be used for all elements)
C   CNNV   ;  Curve number for native vegetation lands
C               * List NNTV of them
C   CNRV   ;  Curve number for riparian vegetation lands
C               * List NRPN of them
C   ICETONV;  Native vegetation ETo - this number corresponds to the appropriate
C               data column in the ET data file listed in the Main Control Data file.
C               * List NNTV of them
C   ICETORV;  Riparian vegetation ETo - this number corresponds to the appropriate
C               data column in the ET data file listed in the Main Control Data file.
C               * List NRPN of them
C   ICCFFNV;  Habitat coefficient to be multiplied with ETo to compute ETc for native 
C               vegetation - this number corresponds to the appropriate data column 
C               in the crop/habitat coefficient data file listed in the Main Control
C               Data File
C               * List NNTV of them
C   ICCFFRV;  Habitat coefficient to be multiplied with ETo to compute ETc for riparian 
C               vegetation - this number corresponds to the appropriate data column 
C               in the crop/habitat coefficient data file listed in the Main Control
C               Data File
C               * List NRPN of them
C   ISTRMRV;  Stream node at which water will be used to satisfy unmet riparain ET 
C               requirement in element IE
C               * Enter 0 if riparian vegetation in element IE has no access to a 
C                 stream node
C
C-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C      IE               CNNV                      CNRV           ICETONV     ICETORV    ICCFFNV     ICCFFRV  ISTRMRV
C-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
